    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Monster Chef</strong>, your kitchen is the battlefield! Play as <strong>Pranzo</strong>, a chef-warrior who hunts monsters and cooks them on the spot using their Chef Weapons. In this roguelite hack-and-slash, battle cute but fierce enemies, explore a <strong>procedurally generated world</strong>, and <strong>build your outstanding inn</strong>. Expand your culinary skills and discover tasty recipes! Sharpen your blade, fire up your salt shaker, dinner is served!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fight and cook monsters right on the battlefield using your Chef Weapons. Season them with Spices in real-time combat and create gourmet dishes with a fast-paced hack &amp; slash system that blends intense action and high-level cuisine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the daily order and serve a diverse clientele of fantasy tribes\u2014elves, orcs, merfolk, and humans\u2014each with unique tastes and requests. Upgrade your inn with stunning furniture and transform it from a humble shack into a prestigious five-star tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing lands of Delizia, an open world with a procedurally generated map, where every day brings a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the rulers of Delizia by preparing grand feasts from the giant bosses you defeat. Unlock new biomes, each teeming with fresh monsters and challenges. Meet a diverse cast of characters, each with their own unique story and personality. Build friendships, offer help when you can, and uncover hidden secrets through exclusive dialogues.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/ad52276af38771b123daf9ebc66180dd.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Monster Chef</strong>, your kitchen is the battlefield! Play as <strong>Pranzo</strong>, a chef-warrior who hunts monsters and cooks them on the spot using their Chef Weapons. In this roguelite hack-and-slash, battle cute but fierce enemies, explore a <strong>procedurally generated world</strong>, and <strong>build your outstanding inn</strong>. Expand your culinary skills and discover tasty recipes! Sharpen your blade, fire up your salt shaker, dinner is served!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/82390e199671fb4744344e46242e63bf.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fight and cook monsters right on the battlefield using your Chef Weapons. Season them with Spices in real-time combat and create gourmet dishes with a fast-paced hack &amp; slash system that blends intense action and high-level cuisine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f26c0fc4cc8923840e087c320341d927.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the daily order and serve a diverse clientele of fantasy tribes\u2014elves, orcs, merfolk, and humans\u2014each with unique tastes and requests. Upgrade your inn with stunning furniture and transform it from a humble shack into a prestigious five-star tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/096f036295f6766bd33c2c95b7c39000.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing lands of Delizia, an open world with a procedurally generated map, where every day brings a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.poster.avif?t=1755089352\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.webm?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/94596d204aa683cb82d5f8b0cc4a27c6.mp4?t=1755089352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the rulers of Delizia by preparing grand feasts from the giant bosses you defeat. Unlock new biomes, each teeming with fresh monsters and challenges. Meet a diverse cast of characters, each with their own unique story and personality. Build friendships, offer help when you can, and uncover hidden secrets through exclusive dialogues.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as Pranzo, a chef-warrior who hunts monsters and cooks them right on the battlefield. In this roguelite, fight cute yet fierce enemies, explore a procedurally generated world, and build your own inn. Refine your culinary skills and master tasty recipes! Get your salt shaker-dinner is served!",
